window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Warriors will reign.</p> <p></p> <p>Eight years have passed since the war that changed Crescentia’s fate. Dylan and Devin are now Rhodi masters, and the balance of the world rests in their hands. Dylan longs to find her place in a society that seeks her rule, torn between the need to honor her duty and the urge to follow her heart. Worse still, uncontrollable magic is growing within her as she fights against an ancient power which threatens to take command. If Dylan fails to overcome it, she’ll lose herself for good.</p> <p></p> <p>A new threat has arrived with a vengeance, promising to destroy the Rhodi and everything they hold dear. Strange warriors have come to the realm, harnessing undeniable abilities, and they will bring an end to the Rhodian empire if they are not stopped.</p> <p></p> <p>Devin promises to find the truth behind these devious newcomers, putting his life on the line as he investigates their arrival. But the true battle wages within him as he struggles to protect his family, finding himself once again reluctantly falling in love.</p> <p></p> <p>Yet truth lies in the shadows, and enemies are around every corner. As a traitor waits to strike, the future of the Rhodi will be altered once more…</p>"; 
